# ===== ARC-0026 stage 1 — probes P1–P9 (throwaway; stage 2 removes every PROBE entry) =====
# All entries live in the DEBUG sections (Spell_Rush has none: end of file) and carry PROBE / ARC0026. The spells and
# the passive reach every player character through ARCANA_Probe_ARC0026.txt (AddSpell / AddPassive on SavegameLoaded),
# so no list or progression changes. Run on the console edition (SE off): the PC deck locks Util spells in combat.
# Anchors: Rush = Rush_Arcana_Created_Aspect_LeapOfFaith (mod, using Rush_SpringAttack); mark on a hit = vanilla
# UND_ServantOfBoooal; the Open Path pair = vanilla MOBILE_NO_AOO / MOBILE_NO_AOO_SOURCE (Interrupt_AttackOfOpportunity);
# aura = vanilla AURA_OF_PROTECTION; pull = vanilla Projectile_VacuumBulb; Force Tunnel animation = vanilla Rush_ForceTunnel.

@loca PROBE26_MARK_NAME Probe Windswept
@loca PROBE26_MARK_DESC ARC-0026 probe: the mark. Can't make Opportunity Attacks against a character with Probe Open Path.
@loca PROBE26_PATH_NAME Probe Open Path
@loca PROBE26_COUNT_NAME Probe Count
@loca PROBE26_COUNT_DESC ARC-0026 probes P3/P8: the turns shown are the marks counted, capped at 2. At your next turn start every Probe Windswept goes.
@loca PROBE26_ENDED_NAME Probe Turn Ended
@loca PROBE26_PUSH_NAME Probe Storm
@loca PROBE26_TOUCH_NAME Probe Touch
@loca PROBE26_MARKSPELL_NAME Probe: Mark
@loca PROBE26_MARKSPELL_DESC ARC-0026 probe: mark an enemy (no roll).
@loca PROBE26_RUSH_NAME Probe: Rush
@loca PROBE26_RUSH_DESC ARC-0026 probes P1/P2: rush up to 9 m to an enemy that isn't marked and strike it. Marked enemies can't be targeted.
@loca PROBE26_OPENPATH_NAME Probe: Open Path
@loca PROBE26_OPENPATH_DESC ARC-0026 probe P6: your allies (and you) get Probe Open Path for the fight; marked enemies should not attack them when they walk away.
@loca PROBE26_COUNTSPELL_NAME Probe: Count
@loca PROBE26_COUNTSPELL_DESC ARC-0026 probes P3/P8: count your marked enemies, release the marks and start the count.
@loca PROBE26_VORTEX_NAME Probe: Vortex
@loca PROBE26_VORTEX_DESC ARC-0026 probe P4: marked enemies within 9 m and every other enemy within 6 m are pulled to the point, once each.
@loca PROBE26_LEAP_NAME Probe: Leap
@loca PROBE26_LEAP_DESC ARC-0026 probe P5: Leap of Faith on the Force Tunnel animation.
@loca PROBE26_STORM_NAME Probe: Storm Push
@loca PROBE26_STORM_DESC ARC-0026 probe P9: a status pushes the enemy 3 m away from you and leaves it Off Balance.

